plementation under `apps/platform/server/services`, and the only executable proof is the Convex handler test (`convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:196-236`, `370-436`). That leaves finalized user/model/process-event archival and degraded related-context reads without the required story-level evidence.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:632:          - \"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:633:          - \"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:634:          - \"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:650:        title: \"The production archive read path paginates after loading the full process archive\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:651:        evidence: \"`listArchiveEntries` reads `by_processId_and_sequence` with `.collect()` and only then slices in `paginateArchiveEntries` (`convex/archiveEntries.ts:139-155`, `261-280`). The story/design describe this store method as returning one bounded page (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:126-127`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:661-668`). The outward page contract is correct, but long-process production reads still materialize the full archive in memory.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:653:          - \"convex/archiveEntries.ts\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:676:        command: \"corepack pnpm exec vitest run convex/archiveEntries.test.ts --environment node\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:685:      - \"`convex/archiveEntries.ts:139-155` uses `collect()` plus in-memory slicing for `listArchiveEntries`, so long-process archive reads are not yet bounded at the persistence layer.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:700:      path: \"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/008-verify.json\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:709:path: /Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/014-verify.json\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:731:      - \"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:732:      - \"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:733:      - \"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:734:      - \"convex/archiveEntries.ts\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:735:      - \"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:736:    reviewScopeSummary: \"Follow-up convergence under impl-lead ruling 012: rechecked the updated Story 1 scope/mapping docs against the current `convex/archiveEntries` and `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` surfaces, then reran the targeted Story 1 test and the configured story gate to validate current readiness.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:741:        rationale: \"Impl-lead ruling 012 and the updated story/test-plan/tech-design text now consistently judge Story 1 on the primitive append/read boundary only. The story now rewrites AC-1.1 and AC-1.4 to primitive-level behavior and maps TC-1.1a/b/c and TC-1.4a/b to `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:51-97`, `156-178`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md:44-54`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:563-569`). The prior scope dispute is closed.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:745:        rationale: \"The prior `collect()`-then-slice observation no longer applies because the cited `listArchiveEntries` implementation is not present in the current `convex/archiveEntries.ts`. That concern is superseded by the new blocking regression below: the Story 1 append/read primitive exports are now absent entirely.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:750:        title: \"The current archiveEntries module no longer exports the Story 1 append/read primitive, and the story gate now fails\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:751:        evidence: \"`convex/archiveEntries.ts` currently contains only validators and `archiveEntriesTableFields` (`convex/archiveEntries.ts:1-45`); it does not export `appendArchiveEntry` or `listArchiveEntries`. `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` still imports those symbols at `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:1-3`, so the targeted Story 1 test now fails immediately with `_handler` undefined, and `corepack pnpm run green-verify` fails in typecheck with `TS2305: Module './archiveEntries.js' has no exported member 'appendArchiveEntry'` and `listArchiveEntries`. A repo search over `convex` and `apps/platform` found no replacement mutation/query export for these primitive functions. This removes the executable Story 1 persistence surface and breaks the configured story gate.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:753:          - \"convex/archiveEntries.ts\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:754:          - \"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:775:        title: \"The current archiveEntries module no longer exports the Story 1 append/read primitive, and the story gate now fails\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:776:        evidence: \"`convex/archiveEntries.ts` currently contains only validators and `archiveEntriesTableFields` (`convex/archiveEntries.ts:1-45`); it does not export `appendArchiveEntry` or `listArchiveEntries`. `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` still imports those symbols at `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:1-3`, so the targeted Story 1 test now fails immediately with `_handler` undefined, and `corepack pnpm run green-verify` fails in typecheck with `TS2305: Module './archiveEntries.js' has no exported member 'appendArchiveEntry'` and `listArchiveEntries`. A repo search over `convex` and `apps/platform` found no replacement mutation/query export for these primitive functions. This removes the executable Story 1 persistence surface and breaks the configured story gate.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:778:          - \"convex/archiveEntries.ts\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:779:          - \"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:815:        command: \"corepack pnpm exec vitest run convex/archiveEntries.test.ts --environment node\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-006.md:824:      - \"`convex/archiveEntries.ts` no longer provides t