n-004.md:519:      - \"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/06-archive-provenance-coherence.md\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/06-archive-provenance-coherence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:520:      - \"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/06-archive-provenance-coherence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:521:      - \"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/06-archive-provenance-coherence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:522:      - \"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/06-archive-provenance-coherence/004-implementor.json\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/06-archive-provenance-coherence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:525:      - \"apps/platform/client/features/processes/archive-section.ts\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/06-archive-provenance-coherence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:529:      - \"tests/service/client/archive-section.test.ts\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/06-archive-provenance-coherence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:538:        evidence: \"`DefaultArchiveReadService.getArchive()` calls `enrichArchiveEntries()` and awaits provenance lookups directly with no error handling (`apps/platform/server/services/archive/archive-read.service.ts:63-67`, `:96-124`). The only degradation path is the later `null` checks in `buildEnrichedArchiveEntry()` (`:176-215`). Reproduced with ad hoc `tsx` stubs: a throwing `getArtifactVersion()` printed `artifact lookup failed`, and a throwing `listProcessSourceProvenance()` printed `source lookup failed`, showing the whole archive read rejects instead of returning the archive page with only the affected entry degraded.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/06-archive-provenance-coherence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:551:        evidence: \"The Story 6 artifact-degradation test stores `degradedArchiveEntryFixture` directly (`tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts:489-513`), so the response is already `entryStatus: 'degraded'` before Story 6 enrichment runs. That means the test would still pass even if artifact lookup degradation were never created at read time. This misses the story anti-shim requirement to prove degradation by failing the enrichment dependency rather than fabricating a degraded response object (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/06-archive-provenance-coherence.md:148-150`).\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/06-archive-provenance-coherence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:563:        evidence: \"`DefaultArchiveReadService.getArchive()` calls `enrichArchiveEntries()` and awaits provenance lookups directly with no error handling (`apps/platform/server/services/archive/archive-read.service.ts:63-67`, `:96-124`). The only degradation path is the later `null` checks in `buildEnrichedArchiveEntry()` (`:176-215`). Reproduced with ad hoc `tsx` stubs: a throwing `getArtifactVersion()` printed `artifact lookup failed`, and a throwing `listProcessSourceProvenance()` printed `source lookup failed`, showing the whole archive read rejects instead of returning the archive page with only the affected entry degraded.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/06-archive-provenance-coherence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:576:        evidence: \"The Story 6 artifact-degradation test stores `degradedArchiveEntryFixture` directly (`tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts:489-513`), so the response is already `entryStatus: 'degraded'` before Story 6 enrichment runs. That means the test would still pass even if artifact lookup degradation were never created at read time. This misses the story anti-shim requirement to prove degradation by failing the enrichment dependency rather than fabricating a degraded response object (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/06-archive-provenance-coherence.md:148-150`).\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/06-archive-provenance-coherence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:595:        command: \"corepack pnpm vitest tests/service/server/archive-api.test.ts tests/service/client/archive-section.test.ts\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/06-archive-provenance-coherence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:611:      - \"The full gate suite stayed green, so the provenance additions did not regress existing archive/turn/derived-view behavior, including prior derived-view traceability coverage from Story 5.\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/06-archive-provenance-coherence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:619:      path: \"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/06-archive-provenance-coherence/005-verify.json\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/06-archive-provenance-coherence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:629:Path: /Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/06-archive-provenance-coherence/story-lead/001-current.json\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/06-archive-provenance-coherence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-004.md:644:    path: \"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/06-archive-provenance-coherence/001-story-validate.json\"\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artif