-story using implementor gate evidence plus verifier acceptance checks; if verifier finds issues, route the smallest quick-fix or continue action.\\\"}\"}}\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:11:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"run-quick-fix\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"The latest verifier result is ok but outcome revise with one blocking major finding: the production Convex archive read path uses collect before pagination, violating the story-local bounded page requirement. The smallest safe next action is a targeted quick fix for that finding before re-verification.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":{\\\"findingRefs\\\":[\\\"story3-bounded-page-production-read\\\"],\\\"remediationGoal\\\":\\\"Update the real Convex archiveEntries read path so it fetches only one bounded page for the requested process/archive cursor/limit instead of collecting the full archive before slicing. Preserve ascending sequence order, cursor semantics, existing route/service contracts, and Story 3 test coverage.\\\"},\\\"selfNote\\\":\\\"After quick-fix completes, run verifier continuation against 005-verify.json plus the quick-fix artifact and require the bounded production read finding to be closed before considering accept-story.\\\"}\"}}\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:15:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"run-verify\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"The quick-fix completed successfully and the prior verifier left one blocking bounded-page production-read finding open, so the smallest safe next action is to resume the existing verifier and require it to evaluate the quick-fix against that prior finding before any acceptance decision.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":{\\\"artifactRefs\\\":[\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/quick-fix/005-quick-fix.json\\\"],\\\"verifierContinuationRef\\\":\\\"storyVerifier\\\",\\\"responseArtifactRef\\\":\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/005-verify.json\\\"},\\\"selfNote\\\":\\\"If verifier continuation returns pass with the bounded production read finding closed and green-verify evidence intact, evaluate accept-story; otherwise route only the smallest remaining fix or block if unresolved.\\\"}\"}}\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:19:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"accept-story\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Latest verifier result passed with no open findings, the prior bounded-page production-read blocker was resolved, all Story 3 acceptance criteria and mapped tests were verified, and the configured story gate passed.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":{\\\"summary\\\":\\\"Story 3 is ready for impl-lead review: authenticated archive read route, durable reload/environment-loss reads, access/error handling, client archive rendering, empty state, degraded entry display, and bounded production archive reads are verified.\\\",\\\"acceptanceCheckRefs\\\":[\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/003-implementor.json\\\",\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/03-archive-read-and-reopen-surface/005-verify.json\\\",\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/quick-fix/005-quick-fix.json\\\",\\\"/Users/leemoore/code